# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
出力 書く: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), 改行.
出力 書く: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), 改行.
出力 書く: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), 改行.
出力 書く: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), 改行.
出力 書く: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), 改行.
出力 書く: ([''] tccompare: ['']), 改行.
